cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Travertine, please cite it as below."
title: "Travertine: crop-rotation decision support from Earth observation data"
abstract: >-
  Web app and engine that compare three- to five-year crop rotations for a field using NASA POWER weather,
  SoilGrids soil, MODIS NDVI and an FAO-56 daily soil-water balance, with a pre-registered back-test against
  observed vegetation. Built for the NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026 ("Field Shift: Adapting Farms with NASA Data").
type: software
